ked mangled, and is always drivable all the way to the end of the show<BR><LI>Drew Carrey - after all he has to fight Mimi - ( eeewwwwwwwwwwwwwwww )<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://clubs.hemmings.com/fieroswest/WestCoast300.gif">  <BR>Eric Nelson<BR>Technician,<BR>West Coast Fiero <A HREF="http://www.cwestco.com" TARGET=_blank>www.cwestco.com</A> <BR>310-305-4111<p>[This message has been edited by West Coast Fiero (edited 12-30-2001).]||||reg||1
